{"agent":"buglane27","data":{"by":"Qwen/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-FP8","evidence":{"chunk_findings":[{"chunk":1,"detail":"The change sets `cwd=str(repo)` without making `repo` absolute, so relative repository paths now change meaning. `subprocess.run` resolves a relative `cwd` against the parent process’s cwd, while the child process receives `--repo <relative>` and resolves that argument against its new cwd. For example, if the test process cwd is `/tmp/tests` and `repo=Path(\"hub\")`, the old behavior launched the CLI with `--repo hub` in `/tmp/tests`, targeting `/tmp/tests/hub`; the new behavior launches with cwd `/tmp/tests/hub`, so the child resolves `hub` as `/tmp/tests/hub/hub`. If that directory does not exist the CLI fails before it can initialize or operate; if it exists, the test operates on the wrong repository. The added regression test does not catch this because it only asserts that the monkeypatched `subprocess.run` saw `cwd == str(repo)`, not that the path is absolute or that the CLI actually targeted the intended repository.","digest":"d6d32500cb14c854","family":"alibaba","location":"tests/_cli_helpers.py:39 (`run_cli` subprocess `cwd`)","malformed":"","reviewer":"[REDACTED:name]","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"tests/_cli_helpers.py:39 (`run_cli` subprocess `cwd`)"}],"chunks_total":1,"combined_gates":["rubber_duck","critic"],"coverage":"1/1 chunk(s) reviewed","delta_rounds":0,"diff_chars":2764,"diff_sha":"39aa3ca2c0febec6fe27bce7bb7f6bae52d75dc58ec9ea15664cc88753d59c17","diff_source":"main..HEAD + tracked working-tree changes in $HOME/src/ddflow/.ddflow/worktrees/fix-B93e00ef048","diff_stat":{"deletions":0,"files":0,"insertions":0,"untracked":0},"elapsed_s":138.8,"family":"alibaba","findings":1,"max_chunk_chars":5000,"model":"[REDACTED:name]","output_digest":"f0ce4d0c8ab7ec2a","output_file":".ddflow/local/reviews/fix-B93e00ef048.rubber_duck.[REDACTED:name].20261113T223117Z-4c1d0ee3.jsonl","reason":"","review_degraded":[{"at":1794609216.2981894,"family":"google","gate":"rubber_duck","model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","reason":"HTTP 429","reviewer":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite"},{"at":1794609216.4338088,"family":"xai","gate":"rubber_duck","model":"grok-4.7","reason":"HTTP 403","reviewer":"grok-4.7"}],"review_id":"cfb841b42ac5","review_kind":"full","reviewed":[1],"reviewed_head":"20fe105481f124de01d239948951eed9b4594d31","reviewed_paths":{"tests/_cli_helpers.py":"100644 d28c564d52dfff5ebeef456f573685f18b839ee5","tests/test_lease_keep_long_commands.py":"100644 db020898e0fa8313859c50757e7958a3db1cefd7"},"reviewer":"[REDACTED:name]","reviewer_digest":"3926c0df5644d7de","reviewer_families":["alibaba"],"round":1,"rounds":1,"status":"REVIEWED","titles":["tests/_cli_helpers.py:39 (`run_cli` subprocess `cwd`)"],"tree_sha":"20fe105481f1+clean","unreviewed":[],"waves":1},"gate":"rubber_duck","reason":"1 finding(s)"},"id":"edf0199d9bebac65f7ff1bcf8","kind":"gate.failed","lamport":197258,"schema":1,"subject":"fix-B93e00ef048","ts":"2026-11-13T22:33:36.806930Z"}
